    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/5d241fc3e29102814e8f47358077998c.poster.avif?t=1749192729\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/5d241fc3e29102814e8f47358077998c.webm?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/5d241fc3e29102814e8f47358077998c.mp4?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartweaver is a 3D puzzle adventure game about loss and healing.\u00a0Follow the journey of Ace and Mark through Ace's twisted mind and help her reconnect with her feelings. Explore beautiful dark worlds that bring Ace's psyche to life, use her emotions to solve puzzles, recover her memories and help her weave a path towards\u00a0healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/599c53f46ad7820c96a21a1d0ad6a3d9.avif?t=1749192729\" data-has-big width=800 height=201 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Ace free her repressed emotions. Connect through her feelings with her mental blocks and dissolve them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/2ea63b8598bdf928c2298327e11861a3.poster.avif?t=1749192729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/2ea63b8598bdf928c2298327e11861a3.webm?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/2ea63b8598bdf928c2298327e11861a3.mp4?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/6ac4ff466ab5aac6b8a927869f71c46f.avif?t=1749192729\" data-has-big width=800 height=201 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange Ace's confused mind. Solve puzzles to clear her thoughts and see things clearly.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/2f6c9c743c3b39885e15d05ad7c23e48.poster.avif?t=1749192729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/2f6c9c743c3b39885e15d05ad7c23e48.webm?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/2f6c9c743c3b39885e15d05ad7c23e48.mp4?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/a27d99f9525fceeae772f14ce202deba.avif?t=1749192729\" data-has-big width=800 height=201 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move forward by using the abilities of Ace's sadness, fear and anger. Let Ace get so sad it slows down time, make her spirit leave her body from the fright and push things far away in a burst of rage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/99ff14431c69d5587029b9ad829c05f6.poster.avif?t=1749192729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/99ff14431c69d5587029b9ad829c05f6.webm?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/99ff14431c69d5587029b9ad829c05f6.mp4?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/8dc26a40e206171eef05a2a4849b9ee9.avif?t=1749192729\" data-has-big width=800 height=201 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Ace's story by travelling through the distorted worlds of her mind. Make the journey alongside Mark and explore every nook and cranny.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/739ff47b8f5c073524a0de6afbd3bd73.poster.avif?t=1749192729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/739ff47b8f5c073524a0de6afbd3bd73.webm?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/739ff47b8f5c073524a0de6afbd3bd73.mp4?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/fd3166084aaf07e1c4e5a9bb2eb0d3b5.avif?t=1749192729\" data-has-big width=800 height=201 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Ace heal from her pain by recovering pieces of her past. Collect tokens from Ace's memories and make her remember her past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/04a1620b1956bf14bdcf172fb1a07709.poster.avif?t=1749192729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/04a1620b1956bf14bdcf172fb1a07709.webm?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/04a1620b1956bf14bdcf172fb1a07709.mp4?t=1749192729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114600/extras/1bd3785f8ac11f18ff240140e03ff73f.avif?t=1749192729\" data-has-big width=800 height=213 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities of the emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
